Eqarat Masr may use third-party services to support application functionality, such as cloud hosting, authentication, crash reporting, analytics, push notifications, or other technical services.

These providers may process relevant information according to their own privacy policies and contractual obligations.

We encourage users to review the privacy policies of any third-party services that are integrated into or accessed through the application.

Our actual third-party disclosures will reflect the services integrated into the released version of Eqarat Masr.

## 8. Children's Privacy

Eqarat Masr is not intended to collect personal information from children in violation of applicable law.

We do not knowingly collect personal information from children where such collection is prohibited or requires consent that has not been obtained.

If you believe that a child has provided personal information inappropriately, please contact us so that we can review the matter and take appropriate action.

